      "en": "From the UK, Umrah outside Hajj season runs on three British passport routes — ETA, e-visa or visa waiver — and every traveller needs a Nusuk permit and an ACWY certificate dated at least 10 days before arrival. Hajj is separate: place only through Nusuk Hajj, and no 2027 dates have been published. Flights are nonstop only from Heathrow and Manchester to Jeddah, and no UK airport flies nonstop to Madinah. The FCDO still advises against all but essential travel to most of Saudi Arabia, and insurance may be invalid if you travel against that advice.",
